      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:tide_pump",
      "text": [
        "Moves fluid from one tank to the tank on its other side, **250 mB** a second. Water from a Spirit Cistern into a Wave Drum, lava from one store to another: any fluid tank works, from this mod or another.",
        "It is a pump, not a tank. It keeps nothing when you break it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Which way it pumps",
      "text": [
        "The pump has a front, the face with the arrow. Like a furnace, it is placed with that face toward you, and you can aim it up or down as well as sideways.",
        "By default it **draws from the tank at its front** and **pushes into the tank at its back**. Crouch and right-click it with an empty hand to reverse that; right-click normally to hear which way it is set.",
        "A comparator reads **15** while it draws from the front and **1** while it pushes into the front."
      ]
    },
